  Local control-plane access
  Allow a local process on this machine to inspect this Codex session and stee

› 1. Allow local control plane  Start the local IPC socket for this session.
  2. Decline for now            Do not start the socket for this launch.

  This creates a per-instance local socket only after you opt in. Declining
  keeps the feature dormant and Codex will ask again on the next launch.
  Press enter to confirm or esc to go back
